# 🗂️ Core ARD / ADaM Functions – Cheat Sheet
|----------------------------|---------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------|
| Category                   | Function                  | Description                                             |
|----------------------------|---------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------|  
| Calculations & Rounding    | add_calculated_row        | Add calculated rows to your ARD                         |
|                            | maximum_variable_value    | Find the maximum value of a variable                    |
|                            | round5                    | Round numbers to the nearest 5                          |
|                            | label_round               | Format labels with rounding                             |
|----------------------------|---------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------|  
| Summaries & Totals         | ard_summary               | Univariate summary of ARD                               |
|                            | ard_mvsummary             | Multivariate ARD summaries                              |
|                            | ard_total_n               | Total N for ARD                                         |
|----------------------------|---------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------|  
| Tabulating & Stratifying   | ard_tabulate              | Tabulate ARD results                                    |
|                            | ard_tabulate_value        | Tabulate values within ARD                              |
|                            | ard_strata                | Stratified summaries                                    |
|----------------------------|---------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------|  
| Hierarchical ARDs          | ard_hierarchical          | Create hierarchical ARD stats                           |
|                            | ard_hierarchical_count    | Count stats for hierarchical ARDs                       |
|                            | sort_ard_hierarchical     | Sort hierarchical ARD stats                             |
|----------------------------|---------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------|
| Structure & Tidy Management| check_ard_structure       | Check ARD structure for correctness                     |
|                            | tidy_ard_order            | Standardize row/column order in ARD                     |
|                            | rename_ard_columns        | Rename variables in ARD                                 |
|                            | rename_ard_groups         | Rename group columns                                    |
|                            | update_ard                | Update ARD with new stats or formatting                 |
|----------------------------|---------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------|
| Conditions & Messages      |captured_condition_as_error| Capture and throw errors for ARD issues                 |
|                            | eval_capture_conditions   | Capture and evaluate conditions                         |
